                          <android.widget.TextView index="1" package="com.cyberlink.powerdirector.DRA140225_01" class="android.widget.TextView" text="【Ashes on the Floor】&#10;Maya struggles to pry loose a charred counter shelf until Caleb steps through the doorway and catches the falling timber for her.&#10;&#10;【Testing the Beams】&#10;Caleb inspects the smoke-blackened ceiling supports and warns Maya that her hasty cleanup is destabilizing the room.&#10;&#10;【Clearing the Heavy Wood】&#10;Working side by side, they haul a scorched counter beam out to the curb together.&#10;&#10;【A Shared Drink】&#10;Sitting on two salvaged crates amidst the dust, Maya shares a thermos of hot tea and notices Caleb's stiffened knee.&#10;&#10;【Hands on the Wall】&#10;While scraping soot off the original brickwork together, their hands brush against the same spot, lingering as Caleb catches her eye.&#10;&#10;【The Ceiling Cracks】&#10;A sharp snap from the overhead joist showers plaster between them, and Caleb steps forward to shield Maya as the ceiling sags.&#10;&#10;Possible Characters:&#10;• Maya Lin — Female lead, determined baker and bakery owner&#10;• Caleb Vance — Male lead, former municipal firefighter" resource-id="com.cyberlink.powerdirector.DRA140225_01:id/text_mini_drama_outline_card_body" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" scrollable="false" selected="false" bounds="[90,88][990,1017]" displayed="true" a11y-important="true" screen-reader-focusable="false" drawing-order="2" showing-hint="false" text-entry-key="false" dismissable="false" a11y-focused="false" heading="false" live-region="0" context-clickable="false" content-invalid="false" window-id="203" />
